    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">As soon as the two‑wheeler arrives, the receiving team conducts a thorough walk‑around under natural light. Daylight eliminates shadows and glare that can hide scratches, dents, or paint defects. The inspector compares every visible area with the high‑resolution pickup photographs taken at the origin.</p>
