      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Pre-Loading Inspection, Odometer Logging &amp; Photographic Audit for Bike Transportation Manasa Secure</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	<p>Transporting two-wheelers and motorcycles requires careful attention to ensure safe and secure transportation. Below is a detailed checklist outlining the pre-loading protocols to follow:</p>

	<p>Before loading two-wheelers and motorcycles onto transportation vehicles, it is essential to conduct a comprehensive condition audit. This audit should cover various aspects to meticulously inspect the vehicle's condition.</p>

