			<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
				<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Check for any scratches, dents, or damages on the bodywork</span></li>
				<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Ensure all accessories like side stands, indicators, and mirrors are securely attached</span></li>
				<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Verify the condition of tires, including tread depth, pressure, and wear</span></li>
			</ul>

		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Interior Inspection:</p>
			<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
				<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Check for any damages or missing parts inside the cabin</span></li>
				<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Verify the functioning of all controls, switches, and indicators</span></li>
				<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Ensure that the fuel tank has been filled up to the recommended level</span></li>
			</ul>

		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Engine & Mechanical Inspection:</p>
			<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
